+#   behavior_trace:
+#     - Original D9 behavior: once flood-fill passed a gap in the near ring, most of the remaining reachability was decided by
+#       a single-stage outer barrier.
+#     - New behavior: flood-fill starts from the single inner opening, enters the first corridor, walks to the next layer's
